{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Brawnly 是一款著重結構與專注的肌力訓練 App，適合希望按目標、訓練經驗、可用器材、身體限制及每星期 1 至 7 天安排訓練，並記錄每次訓練進度的人士。它由原價 US $0.99 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，核心體驗可離線使用，訓練資料保存在裝置上。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-54.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>個人化訓練與進度追蹤</h2>\n<p>Brawnly 可依目標、訓練經驗、可用器材、身體限制與每星期 1 至 7 天安排，自動準備每週及每日訓練。訓練時記錄重量、次數與組數，配合休息計時器及自訂流程；運動目錄提供示範圖片、肌肉與器材資料。進度頁可查看歷史、訓練量、連續紀錄、圖表、個人紀錄與身體測量，核心功能離線可用，資料保存在裝置上。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-73-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-74-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-75-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-76-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-77-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-78-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Brawnly: Strength Training</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/brawnly-strength-training/id6804473310?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T18:41:24.513053+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":352,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T18:33:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T09:18:27.125341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T18:38:42.256457+00:00","content_hash":"360c02f973c050ca276c4823ae5f4e626efb3adcc6e8d3b6c9beaeea39f4fab0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T18:41:24.513053+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}